OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant flooding' prompts
OL,4,Afire crew call outs
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlooding has hit the West Midlands
OL,7,Fafter heavy rain.
OL,9,FThe Environment Agency (EA) issued a
OL,10,Fflood warning for Birmingham on
OL,11,FWednesday night, with fire crews called
OL,12,Fto "significant flooding" in Perry Barr
OL,13,Faround Curbar Road, Thornbridge Avenue
OL,14,Fand Haddon Road, telling people to
OL,15,Favoid the area.
OL,17,FIn south Staffordshire there was a
OL,18,Flower-level flood alert, with parts of
OL,19,FChasetown affected. The alert remains
OL,20,Fin place.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
