OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant flooding' prompts
OL,4,Afire crew call outs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow thunderstorm warning is also
OL,7,Fin place for England until 22:00 BST on
OL,8,FThursday, with Birmingham seeing heavy
OL,9,Fdownpours just before 08:00 although
OL,10,Fthe flood warning is now removed.
OL,11,FAnother, however, has been introduced
OL,12,Ffor Bromsgrove, Worcestershire.
